msgid "For a successfully registered 20 GiB prefix, the result is:"
msgstr "对于成功注册的 20 GiB 前缀，结果为："

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/raw_block.rst:210
msgid ""
"Failed or skipped registration reports ``false`` and ``0``, as does a "
"closed adapter. Successful registration does not mean every request uses "
"fixed I/O: requests outside the registered prefix or crossing a region "
"boundary still use ordinary io_uring. When comparing performance, verify "
"these fields and keep ``enable_zero_copy`` enabled in both cases to "
"isolate registration from direct-buffer I/O."
msgstr "注册失败或被跳过时，报告为 ``false`` 和 ``0``，关闭的适配器也是如此。成功注册并不意味着每个请求都使用固定的 I/O：在注册前缀之外或跨越区域边界的请求仍然使用普通的 io_uring。在比较性能时，请验证这些字段，并在两种情况下都保持 ``enable_zero_copy`` 启用，以将注册与直接缓冲区 I/O 隔离。"

