#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/raw_block.rst:242
msgid "**Failure handling and shutdown:**"
msgstr "**故障处理和关闭：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/raw_block.rst:244
msgid ""
"Recoverable ``io_uring`` submission errors (``EAGAIN``, ``EINTR``, "
"``EBUSY``) retry after completion progress or 1–100 ms exponential "
"backoff. Permanent errors, or 30 seconds without submission or completion"
" progress, mark the worker unhealthy and stop new native I/O. The core "
"status exposes the failure reason as ``worker_error``."
msgstr "可恢复的 ``io_uring`` 提交错误（``EAGAIN``、``EINTR``、``EBUSY``）在完成进度后或 1–100 毫秒的指数退避后重试。永久错误或 30 秒内没有提交或完成进度将标记工作线程为不健康，并停止新的本地 I/O。核心状态将失败原因暴露为 ``worker_error``。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/raw_block.rst:250
msgid ""
"After a known worker failure, new prefetch tasks report failure through "
"their normal task results and new stores are skipped. The adapter still "
"publishes completion results and notifications so controllers can release"
" locks and buffers; the serving engine can recompute missing data instead"
" of receiving a synchronous storage exception. Valid hits from L1 or "
"other L2 adapters remain usable. The legacy non-MP raw-block backend also"
" skips new stores after worker failure."
msgstr "在已知的工作线程故障后，新预取任务通过其正常的任务结果报告故障，并跳过新的存储。适配器仍然发布完成结果和通知，以便控制器可以释放锁和缓冲区；服务引擎可以重计算缺失的数据，而不是接收同步存储异常。来自 L1 或其他 L2 适配器的有效命中仍然可用。传统的非 MP 原始块后端在工作线程故障后也会跳过新的存储。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/raw_block.rst:258
msgid ""
"Already-accepted I/O retains its buffers until completion or successful "
"cancellation. Close and destructor cleanup release the Python GIL while "
"waiting, but can still block indefinitely if accepted I/O cannot finish "
"or be cancelled. The 30-second submission retry budget is not a shutdown "
"timeout."
msgstr "已接受的 I/O 在完成或成功取消之前会保留其缓冲区。关闭和析构清理在等待时会释放 Python GIL，但如果已接受的 I/O 无法完成或取消，仍可能无限期阻塞。30 秒的提交重试预算不是关闭超时。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/raw_block.rst:263
msgid "**Hardware-gated FDP status validation:**"
msgstr "**硬件门控的 FDP 状态验证：**"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/raw_block.rst:265
msgid ""
"FDP live-device validation is opt-in because it requires an FDP-capable "
"NVMe namespace character device. The status probe opens the character "
"device through the Rust raw-block binding and calls "
"``fetch_fdp_status()`` with a read-only file descriptor. It does not "
"issue writes, initialize the MP adapter layout, write KV data, or verify "
"the MP adapter's cache-salt placement policy."
msgstr "FDP 实时设备验证是可选的，因为它需要一个支持 FDP 的 NVMe 命名空间字符设备。状态探测通过 Rust 原始块绑定打开字符设备，并使用只读文件描述符调用 ``fetch_fdp_status()``。它不会发出写入、初始化 MP 适配器布局、写入 KV 数据或验证 MP 适配器的 cache-salt 放置策略。"

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/raw_block.rst:276
msgid ""
"When the variable is not set, the test skips. If the configured device, "
"kernel, or controller does not support the FDP status query, the test "
"skips with the underlying capability error. A passing status probe only "
"confirms that the live device can answer the FDP status query; full "
"adapter initialization and KV write placement on hardware are separate "
"validations."
msgstr "当变量未设置时，测试将跳过。如果配置的设备、内核或控制器不支持 FDP 状态查询，测试将因底层能力错误而跳过。通过的状态探测仅确认实时设备可以回答 FDP 状态查询；完整的适配器初始化和硬件上的 KV 写入位置是单独的验证。"

